  "notes": [
    "Haarlemmerweg 73-75 (pand 0363100012084332, built 1983): the middle block of the 1983 buff-brick social-housing scheme at Haarlemmerweg 63-89, facing the Haarlemmervaart and the Westerpark; four storeys over a low dark basement band, 13.1 m.",
    "walls[0] the Haarlemmerweg front (panel 4, crop w02-359L 2021-02-24, square on): wide white-framed windows on bays 1 and 4, a narrow one on bay 3, the glazed stair tower on bay 2, the dark basement band (cladding paint).",
